      <div class="nrh-eyebrow">Meet Daniel</div>
      <h2>A few steps further up the road.</h2>
      <p>I&rsquo;m a husband, a father, and a Christian &mdash; and I started this channel because I&rsquo;ve come to believe something I wish more hurting people could hear: you don&rsquo;t have to have everything figured out to keep walking with God.</p>
      <p class="pull">Sometimes the most spiritual thing you can say to someone isn&rsquo;t a complicated answer. It&rsquo;s: I&rsquo;m here. You&rsquo;re not alone. Let&rsquo;s take the next step together.</p>
      <p>I became a Christian at four years old, in London, England. Years later, at a Bible school in the Colorado mountains, I learned that the road isn&rsquo;t always easy &mdash; sometimes you can only see a few feet ahead. But you keep walking. And the road was taking you somewhere all along.</p>
